%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_08_WhyNow
  questionId: COMM-08
  category: 2
  speakerName: Sales Director
  questionText: >-
    An executive asks why this matters now when the team has lived with the current risk for years. What is your answer?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_08_A1
  answerText: >-
    Tie urgency to changed exposure, audit pressure, and the cost of waiting one more planning cycle.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_08_A2
  answerText: >-
    Say attackers are moving faster and show the latest threat statistics.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: 0
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_08_A3
  answerText: >-
    Admit urgency is their call, then ask what business event would make the risk unacceptable.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_08_A4
  answerText: >-
    Push back that living with risk is not the same as managing it, then ask who owns the decision if nothing changes.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: -1
